1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:02,670
Job hunting is a full-time job.

2
00:00:02,670 --> 00:00:05,770
With zero pay, and way too many dropdowns.

3
00:00:05,770 --> 00:00:08,040
Meet Job Hunter Agent.

4
00:00:08,040 --> 00:00:10,440
Step one: dump everything on it.

5
00:00:10,440 --> 00:00:14,410
Old résumés, reference letters, that paper nobody read.

6
00:00:14,410 --> 00:00:16,230
Or just hit the mic and ramble.

7
00:00:16,230 --> 00:00:17,780
It's a great listener.

8
00:00:17,780 --> 00:00:19,240
It writes your story from that.

9
00:00:19,240 --> 00:00:20,120
True stuff only.

10
00:00:20,480 --> 00:00:22,430
No surprise PhD.

11
00:00:22,430 --> 00:00:26,020
Step two: it finds the roles and scores how well you fit.

12
00:00:26,020 --> 00:00:29,120
Goodbye, “entry level, ten years required.”

13
00:00:29,120 --> 00:00:31,880
Step three: your résumé is tailored and the form is filled.

14
00:00:32,150 --> 00:00:34,520
Every single dropdown.

15
00:00:34,520 --> 00:00:37,090
Nothing goes out until you hit Approve.

16
00:00:37,740 --> 00:00:41,150
Then it watches your inbox and tells you who wrote back.

17
00:00:41,150 --> 00:00:42,460
Job Hunter Agent.

18
00:00:42,460 --> 00:00:43,500
It does the grind.

19
00:00:43,500 --> 00:00:44,900
You do the talking.
